    - Agent Token Budget: 82,735 / 270,000 used (31%)\n- Agent Age: 21 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Recovery v4 replica: Analytic-Jacobian SLSQP with multi-hole+jitter seeds (strict guard + 1e-9 shrink)' (ID: 517) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.629571908444254\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.629572\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Boundary-Equality SLSQP Multi-start (consensus boundary at tol=1e-8)' (ID: 518) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.629571909\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.629572\n\n**Full Execution\
