  I''m confirming that any YAML string value with a colon should be quoted, so I’ll quote the abstract. Including code content is good too. I might also consider the meta prompt update, but it seems it''s not necessary right now. The user hasn’t requested any changes. I should double-check that our code is using `minimize` from SciPy — it’s heavy with 88 seeds and 900 iterations. I’ll ensure the code is identical to the previous version, especially the "holes" list and jitter settings.


