tick: 337
role: model
parts:
- text: "Consolidating reproducibility and tables for the paper: creating an aggregated tables JSON and checksums for the restored SOTA snapshot, plus a repro README.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Aggregate paper tables: SOTA_243 + gates + tangent attempts (analysis-only)\"\ntags: \"analysis, export, aggregation, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Reads SOTA_243 summary, dual-tolerance gate results (slack/KKT), and tangent-step logs; writes a consolidated paper_tables.json under exports/. Returns the SOTA snapshot with a 1e-9 shrink.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, numpy as np\n\n  N = 26\n  SAFETY = 1e-9\n\n  P_C = 'storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt'\n  P_R = 'storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt'\n  P_SUM_SOTA = 'storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/summary_tol1e8.json'\n  P_SUM_FALL = 'storage/noesis/exports/summary_tol1e8.json'\n  P_GATE_SLACK = 'storage/noesis/exports/operator_gate_dual_tol_latest.json'\n  P_GATE_KKT   = 'storage/noesis/exports/operator_gate_dual_tol_kkt_latest.json'\n\
    \  P_TAN_V1     = 'storage/noesis/exports/tangent_step_attempt_v1.json'\n  P_TAN_V2     = 'storage/noesis/exports/tangent_step_attempt_v2.json'\n  OUT_JSON     = 'storage/noesis/exports/paper_tables.json'\n\n  def load_json(path):\n      if os.path.exists(path):\n          try:\n              with open(path, 'r') as f:\n                  return json.load(f)\n          except Exception:\n              return None\n      return None\n\n  def load_snapshot():\n      c = np.loadtxt(P_C, dtype=float).reshape(N,2)\n      r = np.loadtxt(P_R, dtype=float).reshape(N,)\n      return c, r\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      c, r = load_snapshot()\n\n      # Collect SOTA summary, prefer sota_243 path\n      s_sota = load_json(P_SUM_SOTA) or load_json(P_SUM_FALL) or {}\n      degree_hist = s_sota.get('degree_histogram', {})\n      sota_entry = {\n          'sum_radii': s_sota.get('sum_radii', float(np.sum(r))),\n          'active_boundary_count': s_sota.get('active_boundary_count', s_sota.get('boundary_count')),\n\
    \          'active_pair_count': s_sota.get('active_pair_count', s_sota.get('pair_count')),\n          'degree_histogram': degree_hist\n      }\n\n      gate_slack = load_json(P_GATE_SLACK) or {}\n      gate_kkt   = load_json(P_GATE_KKT) or {}\n      tan_v1     = load_json(P_TAN_V1) or {}\n      tan_v2     = load_json(P_TAN_V2) or {}\n\n      out = {\n          'sota_243': sota_entry,\n          'gate_slack_dual_tol': {\n              'tols': gate_slack.get('policy', {}).get('tols'),\n              'K_map': gate_slack.get('policy', {}).get('K_map'),\n              'has_candidate': gate_slack.get('has_candidate'),\n              'common_pairs_count': gate_slack.get('common_pairs_count'),\n          },\n          'gate_kkt_dual_tol': {\n              'tols': gate_kkt.get('policy', {}).get('tols'),\n              'K_map': gate_kkt.get('policy', {}).get('K_map'),\n              'has_candidate': gate_kkt.get('has_candidate'),\n              'common_pairs_count': gate_kkt.get('common_pairs_count'),\n\
    \          },\n          'tangent_attempts': [\n              {'version':'v1',\n               'status': 'trust_region_failed' if 'trust_region_failed' in str(tan_v1.get('error','')) else tan_v1.get('error'),\n               'last_tau': tan_v1.get('last_tau'),\n               'hinges': tan_v1.get('hinges')\n              },\n              {'version':'v2',\n               'status': 'trust_region_failed' if 'trust_region_failed' in str(tan_v2.get('error','')) else tan_v2.get('error'),\n               'last_tau': tan_v2.get('last_tau'),\n               'hinges': tan_v2.get('hinges')\n              }\n          ]\n      }\n\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(OUT_JSON), exist_ok=True)\n      try:\n          with open(OUT_JSON, 'w') as f:\n              json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n\n      # Return SOTA snapshot with tiny shrink\n      return c.astype(float), np.maximum(r - SAFETY, 1e-6).astype(float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\n\
    title: \"SOTA_243 snapshot checksums (analysis-only)\"\ntags: \"analysis, reproducibility, checksum\"\nabstract: \"Computes sha256 checksums for latest_centers/radii and writes to exports/checksums.json. Returns the SOTA snapshot with a 1e-9 shrink.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, hashlib, numpy as np\n\n  N = 26\n  SAFETY = 1e-9\n  P_C = 'storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt'\n  P_R = 'storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt'\n  OUT = 'storage/noesis/exports/checksums.json'\n\n  def sha256_file(path):\n      h = hashlib.sha256()\n      with open(path, 'rb') as f:\n          for chunk in iter(lambda: f.read(8192), b''):\n              h.update(chunk)\n      return h.hexdigest()\n\n  def load_snapshot():\n      c = np.loadtxt(P_C, dtype=float).reshape(N,2)\n      r = np.loadtxt(P_R, dtype=float).reshape(N,)\n      return c, r\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      c, r = load_snapshot()\n      data = {}\n      try:\n          data['latest_centers.txt'] = sha256_file(P_C)\n          data['latest_radii.txt']\
    \   = sha256_file(P_R)\n          os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(OUT), exist_ok=True)\n          with open(OUT, 'w') as f:\n              json.dump(data, f, indent=2)\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n      return c.astype(float), np.maximum(r - SAFETY, 1e-9).astype(float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noesis/exports/README_repro.md}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Reproducibility — n=26 (Noesis lineage)\n  ## Quick start\n  - Snapshot (restored by Eval 525): `storage/noesis/latest_{centers,radii}.txt`\n  - SOTA exports: `storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/*`\n  - Aggregated tables: `storage/noesis/exports/paper_tables.json`\n  - Checksums: `storage/noesis/exports/checksums.json`\n\n  ## Validate snapshot\n  1) Load `latest_centers.txt` and `latest_radii.txt`; sum(r) ≈ 2.6342924.\n  2) Compare checksums with `exports/checksums.json`.\n\n  ## Analysis artifacts\n  - Dual‑tol gates (slack/KKT): `exports/operator_gate_dual_tol_latest.json`, `exports/operator_gate_dual_tol_kkt_latest.json`\n\
    \  - Tangent micro‑step logs: `exports/tangent_step_attempt_{v1,v2}.json`\n  - Active‑set summaries at tol ∈ {1e−9, 5e−9, 1e−8}: `exports/sota_243/summary_tol*.json`\n\n  ## Code utilities\n  - `storage/noesis/compare_utils.py` — exports active sets, degree histograms, and top‑10 pair slacks.\n  - `storage/noesis/analyze_contacts.py` — actives and contact reports.\n  - `storage/noesis/operators_integration.py` — equality‑SLSQP scaffold (boundary‑preserving).\n```"
