    \ table (hinge sets, τ, outcomes).\n  - Reproducibility:\n    - Paper tables JSON: exports/paper_tables.json (ready).\n    - Checksums: exports/checksums.json (ready).\n    - README_repro.md (ready).\n    - Manifest: exports/archive_manifest.json (ready).\n  - Final pass:\n    - Sanity‑check numbers after tiny tol changes (1e−9 ↔ 2e−8).\n    - Spellcheck/consistency on notation and file paths.\n    - Prepare Archive capsule with abstract (archive_abstract.txt) and links to manifest and figure/table sources.\n```"
