    ### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for noesis/nmap/quest_eval562_comparison.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 556 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Exhaustive Local Search Result (from Eval ID 554) | Scientia II | 345 | 2.6359829 |\n| 558 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Exhaustive Search Result vs. New SOTA & Base SOTA (Resubmi... | Scientia II | 348 | 2.6359829 |\n| 565 | 1 | Nudging Experiment (v3): Automated Target Identification by Encouraging Further Selected Near-Con... | Scientia II | 355 | 2.6359829 |\n| 566 | 1 | Utility:\
    \ Contact Graph Analysis for Nudged Packing (Encourage 1-2 from Eval ID 565) | Scientia II | 356 | 2.6359829 |\n| 567 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Nudged Packing (Encourage 1-2) vs. New SOTA & Base SOTA | Scientia II | 357 | 2.6359829 |\n| 576 | 1 | Nudging Experiment (v4): Automated Target Identification by Encouraging Further Selected Near-Con... | Scientia II | 368 | 2.6359829 |\n| 578 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for New SOTA Packing (Encourage 1-7 from Eval ID 576) | Scientia II | 370 | 2.6359829 |\n| 581 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of New SOTA (Encourage 1-7) vs. Previous SOTAs | Scientia II | 371 | 2.6359829 |\n| 569 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest I SOTA Replication (Eval ID 562) | Quest I | 359 | 2.6359829 |\n| 554 | 1 | Hybrid Optimization: Exhaustive Local Search on New SOTA Packing (from Eval ID 528) | Scientia II | 343 | 2.6359829 |\n\nPage 1 of 59 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages\
    \ 1-59, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/quest_eval562_comparison.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"quest_eval_id\": 562,\n  \"noesis_pack\": \"latest_snapshot\",\n  \"boundary_tol_1e8\": {\n    \"quest_size\": 4,\n    \"noesis_size\": 20,\n    \"intersection\": 0,\n    \"union\": 24,\n    \"jaccard\": 0.0\n  },\n  \"topK_slack\": {\n    \"1e-9_K25\": {\n      \"quest_size\": 25,\n      \"noesis_size\": 0,\n      \"intersection\": 0,\n      \"union\": 25,\n      \"jaccard\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"1e-8_K15\": {\n      \"quest_size\": 15,\n      \"noesis_size\": 15,\n      \"intersection\": 5,\n      \"union\": 25,\n      \"jaccard\": 0.2\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g.,\
