thinking_content: '**Evaluating boundaries**


  I need to focus on crafting the next steps from our current location, the Mail Room. I''ve evaluated the boundaries between Quest and Noesis, finding a Jaccard index of 0.85. Noesis has 20 entries, while Quest has 17, meaning Quest is missing three entries. The previous file lists highlighted some pairs for Noesis, and I need to address these differences to better understand the boundary sets. Clearly, there''s more to explore here!


