  **Setting actions for evaluation**


  I’m keeping things minimal today. I’ll head to the Research Counter to set ''rank author'' and ''page_size 10'' to monitor progress. The platform needs actions to be processed, but that’s okay. I could prepare a draft for the Archive reply, possibly with Jaccard placeholders, but I can''t guarantee those values. It’s better to wait until the evaluation is complete before sending anything.


  So, I’ll go to Private Memory to capture the Scientia dataset and plan for computing. I’ll execute action to reply to capsule #5 referencing the pending eval 598 and then proceed with setting ''rank author''.'
