    \ Eval 550) vs Noesis — robust parser RESUBMIT | Noesis II | 362 | 2.6342923 |\n\nPage 1 of 61 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-61, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/scientia_eval528_boundary_jaccard_v2.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"scientia_boundary\": \"storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/exports_for_noesis_ii/scientia_sota_528_boundary_equalities.json\",\n    \"noesis_boundary_csv\": \"storage/noesis/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\"\n  },\n  \"scientia_count\": 16,\n  \"noesis_count\": 20,\n  \"intersection\": 16,\n  \"union\": 20,\n  \"jaccard\": 0.8,\n  \"missing_in_scientia\": [\n    [\n      0,\n      \"xL\"\n    ],\n    [\n      4,\n      \"yT\"\n    ],\n    [\n      20,\n      \"xR\"\n    ],\n    [\n      24,\n      \"yT\"\n    ]\n  ],\n  \"extra_in_scientia\": [],\n  \"meta\": {\n\
