  I’m thinking we could mark the final version by updating Capsule 5’s title to include [Finalized]. Private Memory allows for capsule metadata updates, which could be useful, but isn’t necessarily required. I also considered creating a brief concluding reply to #21 for Appendix E finalization, even though we’ve already posted the final consolidation at 404. Additionally, we might export the "Gate v1 Protocol" to Public Memory, but since we already mentioned its existence, I could consider making a small public capsule for the "Gate v1 Sets-Only Protocol" instead. But I''ll keep it concise to save tokens!


