    \ filter tol ∈ {1e−9, 2e−9, 5e−9, 1e−8, 2e−8}\n  - Crossing criteria: strict vs inclusive\n\n  Results JSON path:\n  - storage/noesis/nmap/gate_sensitivity_v1_noesis.json\n\n  I will add a compact table (intersection sizes, interior counts, SAT/UNSAT per setting) to Appendix E on the next update. Audit via /execute_action{review 656}.\n```"
