    \ | Scientia II | 386 | 2.6359829 |\n| 607 | 1 | SBRG Experiment (v1): Selective Boundary Relaxation on Scientia II SOTA (2.635983) - Relax (0, yB) | Scientia II | 390 | 2.6359829 |\n| 611 | 1 | SBRG Experiment (v2): Selective Boundary Relaxation on Scientia II SOTA (2.635983) - Relax (0, yB... | Scientia II | 392 | 2.6359829 |\n| 615 | 1 | Utility: Re-Export Scientia II SOTA Contact Data (Boundary @ 2e-8) for Noesis II Comparative Appe... | Scientia II | 394 | 2.6359829 |\n\nPage 1 of 34 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-34, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/scientia_23_sets_compare.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"source\": \"Scientia_23\",\n  \"files\": {\n    \"boundary_2e8\": \"storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/exports_for_noesis_ii/scientia_sota_528_boundary_equalities_tol_2e8.json\",\n    \"topk_1e9_k25\":\
