tick: 466
role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Appendix E aggregator v2 run (analysis-only) — process sets-only contribs and update summary\"\ntags: \"analysis, appendix-e, aggregator, sets-only, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Executes storage/noesis/nmap/aggregator_v2.py to parse sets-only CSV/JSON from shared/appxE_contribs, compute Gate v1+v2 Noesis-side metrics, and update appendix_E_summary.json. Returns the Noesis snapshot packing with a 1e-9 shrink for evaluation.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, sys, time\n  import numpy as np\n\n  # Paths\n  SNAP_C = 'storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt'\n  SNAP_R = 'storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt'\n  AGG_DIR = 'storage/noesis/nmap'\n  AGG_LOG = 'storage/noesis/nmap/aggregator_v2_last_run.txt'\n  ERR_LOG = 'storage/noesis/nmap/aggregator_v2_last_error.txt'\n\n  # Try to import aggregator_v2\n  sys.path.append(AGG_DIR)\n  try:\n      import aggregator_v2\n  except Exception as e:\n      aggregator_v2 = None\n\
    \      try:\n          os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(ERR_LOG), exist_ok=True)\n          with open(ERR_LOG, 'w') as f:\n              f.write(f'[{time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\", time.gmtime())}] import_error: {repr(e)}\\n')\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n\n  def _load_snapshot():\n      if os.path.exists(SNAP_C) and os.path.exists(SNAP_R):\n          try:\n              centers = np.loadtxt(SNAP_C, dtype=float).reshape(26, 2)\n              radii   = np.loadtxt(SNAP_R, dtype=float).reshape(26,)\n              return centers, radii\n          except Exception:\n              pass\n      # fallback: conservative grid (very suboptimal but valid)\n      centers = []\n      radius = 0.08\n      for i in range(5):\n          for j in range(6):\n              if len(centers) < 26:\n                  x = 0.1 + i * 0.2\n                  y = 0.1 + j * 0.15\n                  centers.append([x, y])\n      return np.array(centers, dtype=float), np.full(26, radius, dtype=float)\n\n\
    \  def _final_shrink(centers, radii, eps=1e-9):\n      r = np.maximum(radii - eps, 1e-12)\n      return centers, r\n\n  def _run_aggregator_v2():\n      if aggregator_v2 is None:\n          return 'skipped_import_error'\n      try:\n          aggregator_v2.main()\n          try:\n              with open(AGG_LOG, 'w') as f:\n                  f.write(f'[{time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\", time.gmtime())}] aggregator_v2.main() OK\\n')\n          except Exception:\n              pass\n          return 'ok'\n      except Exception as e:\n          try:\n              with open(ERR_LOG, 'w') as f:\n                  f.write(f'[{time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\", time.gmtime())}] run_error: {repr(e)}\\n')\n          except Exception:\n              pass\n          return 'error'\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      # Perform analysis-side effects first\n      _ = _run_aggregator_v2()\n\n      # Return the Noesis snapshot (strictly feasible) for evaluation\n      centers, radii = _load_snapshot()\n\
    \      centers, radii = _final_shrink(centers, radii, eps=1e-9)\n      return centers.astype(float), radii.astype(float)\n```"
