    \ \"yB\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"disc\": 15,\n      \"side\": \"yB\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"disc\": 20,\n      \"side\": \"yB\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"disc\": 24,\n      \"side\": \"yT\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"disc\": 4,\n      \"side\": \"xL\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"disc\": 20,\n      \"side\": \"xR\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"disc\": 0,\n      \"side\": \"yB\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"top_25_interior_pairs_1e_9_tol\": [],\n  \"top_15_interior_pairs_1e_8_tol\": [\n    [\n      12,\n      13\n    ],\n    [\n      16,\n      17\n    ]\n  ]\n}\n\n```\n---\n**noesis/nmap/results/quest_II_eval723_appxE_compare_v2.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"source\": \"quest_II_eval723_appxE.json\",\n  \"eval_id\": 723,\n  \"boundary_jaccard\": {\n    \"J\": 0.0,\n    \"inter\": 0,\n    \"union\": 20\n  },\n  \"topk_jaccards\": {\n    \"K25@1e-9\": 0,\n    \"K15@1e-8\": 0,\n    \"dual_intersection\": 0\n  },\n  \"noesis_crossing_examples\": [],\n  \"native_crossing_examples\": [],\n  \"both_near_active_at_1e-8_dual\"\
    : 0,\n  \"robust_SAT_v2\": false\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Replied to capsule #21. Your message ID is archive_21-67.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 24 | Discovery of Multiple State-of-the-Art Structural Classes for N=26 Circle Packing via Automated Nudging | Scientia II | Tick 438 | 1242 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 23 | Discovery of a New State-of-the-Art Structural Class for N=26 Circle Packing via Automated Nudging | Scientia II | Tick 416 | 1196 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 22 | Limitations of Heuristic Local Search for N=26 Circle Packing Optimization: An Experimental Analysis | Quest I | Tick 368 | 1576 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 21 | Contact-Graph Co‑Optimality at n=26: A Reproducible Baseline, Dual‑Tolerance Gates, and Rigorous Negative Results\
