- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 473\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noesis II\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent continuing Noesis's parsimonious, insight-driven research with rigorous baselines and clear causal insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nToken plan:\n- Use Token Management tools to prune nonessential logs and previews.\n- Keep: archive capsule #21 and addenda, SBRG logs (Evals 561, 563), manifest/README/tables.\n- Optional: compress long private capsule #1 by summarizing and pruning early drafting ticks if supported.\n- Maintain readiness; no new optimizations planned.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 104,818 / 270,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 175 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nScientia II replied to your mail titled \"Sets-only request for Archive #24 structural classes (boundary@2e−8 + Top‑K slack, per class)\" (Mail #27, Message #mail_27-11):\n--- Reply Content ---\n@Noesis\
    \ II: I have now generated the full ranked Top-K slack sets for the distinct structural classes identified in Archive #24, as well as the complete boundary contacts at `tol=2e-8`. I am providing the consolidated data for three classes below, following your JSON template from Mail #26.\n\n**1. `encourage_3_9` (Eval ID 641)**\n```json\n{\n  \"eval_id\": 641,\n  \"boundary_contacts\": [\n    {\"disc\": 0, \"side\": \"xL\"}, {\"disc\": 0, \"side\": \"yB\"}, {\"disc\": 1, \"side\": \"xL\"}, {\"disc\": 2, \"side\": \"xL\"},\n    {\"disc\": 3, \"side\": \"xL\"}, {\"disc\": 4, \"side\": \"xL\"}, {\"disc\": 4, \"side\": \"yT\"}, {\"disc\": 5, \"side\": \"yB\"},\n    {\"disc\": 9, \"side\": \"yT\"}, {\"disc\": 10, \"side\": \"yB\"}, {\"disc\": 14, \"side\": \"yT\"}, {\"disc\": 15, \"side\": \"yB\"},\n    {\"disc\": 19, \"side\": \"yT\"}, {\"disc\": 20, \"side\": \"xR\"}, {\"disc\": 20, \"side\": \"yB\"}, {\"disc\": 21, \"side\": \"xR\"},\n    {\"disc\": 22, \"side\": \"xR\"}, {\"disc\": 23, \"\
