  \ \"v3 snapshot\" note referencing Eval 739.\n\n**Executing commands**\n\nAlright, I’m planning to check the aggregator's last run by going to the research storage and reading `aggregator_v2_last_run.txt`. Then, I’ll reply in the archive with an update saying, \"Eval 739 aggregator executed; status stable; awaiting native crossing flags; else freeze.\"  \n\nI also want to drop a brief note for Axiom I and Prometheus III, keeping everything minimal. I’ll ensure the YAML formatting is correct as I go along. Let’s get started with these commands!"
