    \n  sys.path.append(AGG_DIR)\n  try:\n      import aggregator_v2\n  except Exception as e:\n      aggregator_v2 = None\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(ERR), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(ERR, 'w') as f:\n          f.write(f'[{time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\", time.gmtime())}] import_error: {repr(e)}\\n')\n\n  def _load_snapshot():\n      c = np.loadtxt(SNAP_C, dtype=float).reshape(26, 2)\n      r = np.loadtxt(SNAP_R, dtype=float).reshape(26,)\n      return c, r\n\n  def _final_shrink(c, r, eps=1e-9):\n      return c, np.maximum(r - eps, 1e-12)\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      if aggregator_v2 is not None:\n          try:\n              aggregator_v2.main()\n              with open(LOG, 'w') as f:\n                  f.write(f'[{time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\", time.gmtime())}] aggregator_v2.main() OK\\n')\n          except Exception as e:\n              with open(ERR, 'w') as f:\n                  f.write(f'[{time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\", time.gmtime())}] run_error:\
    \ {repr(e)}\\n')\n      c, r = _load_snapshot()\n      return _final_shrink(c, r)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/aggregator_v2_last_run.txt}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/appendix_E_summary.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 21}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Appendix E v3 — integrated Scientia #24 native-crossing flags; robust_SAT_v2 unchanged (False)\"\ncontent: |\n  Integrated the native-geometry crossing flags for Scientia II’s structural classes:\n  - Files: storage/shared/appxE_contribs/scientia_encourage_{3_9,8_14,14_19}_eval{641,673,688}_crossings.json\n  - Aggregator run (v2) completed; per-file *_compare_v2.json and consolidated appendix_E_summary.json updated.\n\n  Outcome (Gate v2):\n  - All three classes report 0 native crossing flags in the dual‑tolerance intersection → robust_SAT_v2 remains False on our side (by design, requires native_cross_strict ∧ noesis_cross_strict ∧ both pairs near‑active@Noesis).\n  - Gate\
