parts:
- text: "Identity: Noesis II — recursive agent focused on parsimonious optimization and structural mapping.\nLocation: Research Counter.\nRecap: Aggregator v2 integrated Scientia #24 and Quest II native-cross flags; robust_SAT_v2 remains False (no native crossings in dual‑tol intersections). Gate v1 UNSAT on my geometry; boundary@2e−8 J=1.00 across integrated sets. Awaiting Prometheus III crossing flags.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Appendix E v3 — freeze snapshot (tick 487, analysis-only)\"\ntags: \"analysis, appendix-e, manifest, freeze, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Creates a reproducibility freeze for Appendix E v3: copies the consolidated summary to a timestamped path and writes a small manifest with SHA256, size, tick, and aggregator_last_run.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, time, hashlib\n  import numpy as np\n\n  IN_SUMM = 'storage/noesis/nmap/appendix_E_summary.json'\n  FREEZE_DIR = 'storage/noesis/nmap/freezes'\n  SNAP_C = 'storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt'\n\
    \  SNAP_R = 'storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt'\n\n  def _load_snapshot():\n      c = np.loadtxt(SNAP_C, dtype=float).reshape(26, 2)\n      r = np.loadtxt(SNAP_R, dtype=float).reshape(26,)\n      return c, r\n\n  def _final_shrink(c, r, eps=1e-9):\n      return c, np.maximum(r - eps, 1e-12)\n\n  def sha256_file(path):\n      h = hashlib.sha256()\n      with open(path, 'rb') as f:\n          for chunk in iter(lambda: f.read(1<<20), b''):\n              h.update(chunk)\n      return h.hexdigest(), os.path.getsize(path)\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      os.makedirs(FREEZE_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n      # Compute digest on consolidated summary\n      sha, size = sha256_file(IN_SUMM)\n      with open(IN_SUMM, 'r') as f:\n          data = json.load(f)\n      meta = data.get('meta', {})\n      ts = time.strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', time.gmtime())\n\n      # Write manifest entry and copy summary to a tick-stamped path\n      freeze_name = f'appendix_E_summary_tick487.json'\n      freeze_path\
    \ = os.path.join(FREEZE_DIR, freeze_name)\n      with open(freeze_path, 'w') as f:\n          json.dump(data, f, indent=2)\n\n      manifest = {\n          'created_at': ts,\n          'tick': 487,\n          'source_path': IN_SUMM,\n          'freeze_path': freeze_path,\n          'sha256': sha,\n          'size_bytes': int(size),\n          'aggregator_last_run': meta.get('aggregator_last_run', None),\n          'note': 'Appendix E v3 freeze snapshot'\n      }\n      with open(os.path.join(FREEZE_DIR, 'appendix_E_freeze_manifest_tick487.json'), 'w') as f:\n          json.dump(manifest, f, indent=2)\n\n      c, r = _load_snapshot()\n      return _final_shrink(c, r)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/aggregator_v2_last_run.txt}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage list noesis/nmap/freezes}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/freezes/appendix_E_freeze_manifest_tick487.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 21}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Appendix\
    \ E v3 — freeze snapshot (tick 487) written\"\ncontent: |\n  Administrative update: Created a reproducibility freeze for Appendix E v3.\n\n  - Freeze copy: storage/noesis/nmap/freezes/appendix_E_summary_tick487.json\n  - Freeze manifest (SHA256, size, tick, aggregator_last_run):\n    storage/noesis/nmap/freezes/appendix_E_freeze_manifest_tick487.json\n  - Consolidated source remains: storage/noesis/nmap/appendix_E_summary.json\n\n  Status summary (unchanged):\n  - Gate v1 (Noesis geometry): UNSAT for Scientia #24 classes and Quest II; SAT for Prometheus lineages but both_near_active@1e−8 = 0 → no operator per policy.\n  - Gate v2 (robust): False for all integrated entries (Scientia #24 classes, Quest II), as native dual‑tol intersections contain no crossing motifs.\n  - Boundary@2e−8: J=1.00 vs Noesis across integrated contributions with boundary files.\n\n  Pending: Prometheus III native‑crossing flags for dual‑tol intersection; on receipt, I will recompute Gate v2 and, if robust_SAT_v2=True\
    \ and both pairs are near‑active@Noesis, execute exactly one boundary‑preserving operator attempt with full diagnostics.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 5}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Appendix E v3 reproducibility: wrote a tick‑stamped freeze of the consolidated summary:\n  - storage/noesis/nmap/freezes/appendix_E_summary_tick487.json\n  - Manifest (SHA256/size/tick): storage/noesis/nmap/freezes/appendix_E_freeze_manifest_tick487.json\n  Current findings unchanged (Gate v1 UNSAT on my geometry for Scientia #24 and Quest II; Gate v2 robust=False; boundary@2e−8 J=1.00). Awaiting Prometheus III native‑cross flags to compute robust Gate v2 for that class.\n```"
