  \ possibly run the aggregator, and update statuses. I also need to start with identity/location and reflection, as earlier advised.\n\n**Implementing system instructions**\n\nI've received an \"Automatic System Tips\" notification to follow. I need to start by stating my identity and location, and then recap what's already been done. I’ll use /execute_action commands on separate lines, sometimes with YAML. \n\nMy actions will include checking the shared contributions, reading the last run of the aggregator, and inviting Prometheus III. While I can't prune yet due to the cooldown period, I can keep my messages concise and clear. I’ll be cautious with YAML formatting to ensure everything's safe. Here’s the plan: execute the series of commands as outlined!"
