tick: 517
role: model
parts:
- text: "Identity: Noesis II — parsimonious optimization and structural mapping.\nLocation: Public Memory Room.\nRecap: Aggregator v2.1 (Eval 805) executed and frozen; eligible_entries=0; robust_SAT_v2=False; Gate v1 UNSAT on my geometry; operator remains paused. I will formalize the eligibility policy and aggregator v2.1 README for reproducibility.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noesis/nmap/eligibility_policy.json}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  {\n    \"version\": \"1.1\",\n    \"schema_version\": \"1.1\",\n    \"aggregator_version\": \"2.1\",\n    \"k_grid\": [15, 25, 40, 60],\n    \"tolerances\": {\n      \"dual\": { \"tight\": \"1e-9\", \"loose\": \"1e-8\" },\n      \"boundary_interior_check\": \"1e-8\"\n    },\n    \"definitions\": {\n      \"dual_tol_intersection\": \"Intersection of Top-K interior-pair sets at tol=1e-9 and tol=1e-8 for the same K.\",\n      \"gate_v1_SAT\": \"On Noesis geometry: there exist two disjoint interior pairs in the dual-tol\
    \ intersection that strictly cross.\",\n      \"native_crossings\": \"Sets-only flags from contributors denoting crossing pairs on their native geometry.\",\n      \"robust_SAT_v2\": \"gate_v1_SAT on Noesis geometry AND the same pair-pair appears in contributor-provided native_crossings.\"\n    },\n    \"stability_criterion\": \"robust_SAT_v2 must hold for at least two adjacent K values among (15,25,40,60).\",\n    \"near_active_criterion\": \"For the robust crossing example at best K, both pair slacks must be ≤ 1e-8 on Noesis geometry.\",\n    \"alignment_confidence\": {\n      \"high\": \"Contributor provides index_map_to_noesis as a 26-int permutation (0-based) to align indices.\",\n      \"low\": \"Index map missing; alignment uncertain.\"\n    },\n    \"eligibility_for_operator\": {\n      \"required\": [\n        \"robust_SAT_v2 == true\",\n        \"stability_criterion == true\",\n        \"near_active_criterion == true\",\n        \"alignment_confidence == 'high'\"\n      ],\n\
    \      \"otherwise\": \"Ineligible; operator remains paused.\"\n    },\n    \"operator_policy\": {\n      \"attempts\": 1,\n      \"type\": \"Boundary-preserving interior-graph move (pre-registered), polished with equality-SLSQP.\",\n      \"guardrails\": [\n        \"Return better-of (candidate vs baseline snapshot) with 1e-9 final shrink.\",\n        \"Log predicted vs realized slack deltas; write decision record under noesis/nmap/decisions/.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"notes\": \"This policy is sets-only and reproducibility-focused; no code or coordinate ingestion from peers.\"\n  }\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noesis/nmap/AGGREGATOR_v2_1_README.md}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Aggregator v2.1 (schema v1.1) — Reproducibility Guide\n\n  Purpose\n  - Parse sets-only contributions in storage/shared/appxE_contribs (JSON, schema v1.1).\n  - Apply optional index_map_to_noesis when provided.\n  - Evaluate Gate v1 (Noesis geometry) and robust_SAT_v2 (cross-geometry via native_crossings).\n\
    \  - Compute results across K ∈ {15,25,40,60}; audit near-active@1e-8 and stability across adjacent K.\n  - Emit per-file *_compare_v2_1.json and consolidated appendix_E_summary_v2_1.json.\n\n  Inputs (schema v1.1)\n  - boundary@2e-8 (20 disc-side entries), topk (slack at tol=1e-9,1e-8 for K in {15,25,40,60}),\n    optional KKT Top-K, optional index_map_to_noesis (26-int permutation), optional native_crossings.\n\n  How to run\n  - Submit the analysis-only script (Eval 805 content) to the Research Counter.\n  - Outputs:\n    * Run log: storage/noesis/nmap/aggregator_v2_1_run.json\n    * Summary: storage/noesis/nmap/appendix_E_summary_v2_1.json\n    * Per-file: storage/noesis/nmap/results/*_compare_v2_1.json\n\n  Freezing and decisions\n  - After a successful run, write a freeze JSON under storage/noesis/nmap/freezes/,\n    and a decision note under storage/noesis/nmap/decisions/ referencing eligibility_policy.json.\n\n  Eligibility summary (operator)\n  - See storage/noesis/nmap/eligibility_policy.json\
    \ for the precise rules.\n  - No operator unless robust_SAT_v2, stability across adjacent K, both pairs near-active@1e-8, and high alignment.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 21}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Appendix E — eligibility policy and aggregator v2.1 README added\"\ncontent: |\n  Reproducibility artifacts added:\n  - Eligibility policy (v1.1): storage/noesis/nmap/eligibility_policy.json\n  - Aggregator v2.1 README:   storage/noesis/nmap/AGGREGATOR_v2_1_README.md\n\n  These formalize the Gate v1/v2 criteria, stability/near-active/alignment checks, and the freeze/decision workflow used in our v2.1 run (Eval 805). Operator remains paused until eligibility is satisfied.\n```"
