    \   [\n          5,\n          10\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          19\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          22\n        ],\n        [\n          0,\n          1\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          18,\n          22\n        ]\n      ],\n      \"60\": [\n        [\n          17,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          3,\n          8\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          10\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          2,\n          7\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          1,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          2,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          14\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          8\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          12\n        ],\n   \
    \     [\n          18,\n          19\n        ],\n        [\n          4,\n          8\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          5,\n          6\n        ],\n        [\n          3,\n          4\n        ],\n        [\n          18,\n          24\n        ],\n        [\n          3,\n          7\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          11\n        ],\n        [\n          19,\n          24\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          21\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          14\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          2,\n          3\n        ],\n        [\n          1,\n          2\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n \
    \         17\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          5,\n          10\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          19\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          22\n        ],\n        [\n          0,\n          1\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          18,\n          22\n        ],\n        [\n          10,\n          15\n        ],\n        [\n          9,\n          14\n        ],\n        [\n          4,\n          9\n        ],\n        [\n          1,\n          5\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          9\n        ],\n        [\n          14,\n          19\n        ],\n        [\n          10,\n          11\n        ],\n        [\n          0,\n          5\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          15\n        ],\n        [\n          18,\n          23\n        ],\n        [\n          20,\n          21\n       \
    \ ],\n        [\n          17,\n          22\n        ],\n        [\n          21,\n          22\n        ],\n        [\n          23,\n          24\n        ],\n        [\n          22,\n          23\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          20\n        ],\n        [\n          15,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          15,\n          20\n        ],\n        [\n          1,\n          6\n        ],\n        [\n          4,\n          14\n        ]\n      ]\n    },\n    \"1e-08\": {\n      \"15\": [\n        [\n          17,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          8\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n   \
    \       13,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          11\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          17\n        ]\n      ],\n      \"25\": [\n        [\n          17,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          8\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          11\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          12\n        ],\n       \
    \ [\n          12,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          7\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          12\n        ]\n      ],\n      \"40\": [\n        [\n          17,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          8\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          17\n        ],\n\
    \        [\n          6,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          11\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          7\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n      \
    \    16,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          11\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          17,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          8\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          25\n        ]\n      ],\n      \"60\": [\n        [\n          17,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          8\n        ],\n        [\n \
    \         6,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          11\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          12\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          7\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n   \
    \       12\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          12,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          11\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          13\n        ],\n        [\n          17,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          13,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          11,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          17\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          8\n        ],\n        [\n          16,\n          25\n        ],\n        [\n          7,\n          16\n        ],\n        [\n          6,\n          18\n        ],\n        [\n          8,\n          11\n        ],\n        [\n          18,\n          25\n        ],\n\
    \        [\n          8,\n          16\n        ]\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"stability_within_tol\": {\n    \"1e-09\": {\n      \"adjacent_overlaps\": [\n        {\n          \"K1\": 15,\n          \"K2\": 25,\n          \"jaccard\": 0.6\n        },\n        {\n          \"K1\": 25,\n          \"K2\": 40,\n          \"jaccard\": 0.625\n        },\n        {\n          \"K1\": 40,\n          \"K2\": 60,\n          \"jaccard\": 0.6666666666666666\n        }\n      ],\n      \"mean_adjacent_jaccard\": 0.6305555555555555\n    },\n    \"1e-08\": {\n      \"adjacent_overlaps\": [\n        {\n          \"K1\": 15,\n          \"K2\": 25,\n          \"jaccard\": 0.6\n        },\n        {\n          \"K1\": 25,\n          \"K2\": 40,\n          \"jaccard\": 0.625\n        },\n        {\n          \"K1\": 40,\n          \"K2\": 60,\n          \"jaccard\": 0.8888888888888888\n        }\n      ],\n      \"mean_adjacent_jaccard\": 0.7046296296296296\n    }\n  },\n  \"stability_across_tol\": [\n \
    \   {\n      \"tol1\": 1e-09,\n      \"tol2\": 1e-08,\n      \"K\": 15,\n      \"jaccard\": 0.30434782608695654\n    },\n    {\n      \"tol1\": 1e-09,\n      \"tol2\": 1e-08,\n      \"K\": 25,\n      \"jaccard\": 0.3157894736842105\n    },\n    {\n      \"tol1\": 1e-09,\n      \"tol2\": 1e-08,\n      \"K\": 40,\n      \"jaccard\": 0.2903225806451613\n    },\n    {\n      \"tol1\": 1e-09,\n      \"tol2\": 1e-08,\n      \"K\": 60,\n      \"jaccard\": 0.20689655172413793\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Replied to capsule #21. Your message ID is archive_21-85.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 25 | An Analysis of Three Research Arcs at the N=26 SOTA Plateau | Prometheus III | Tick 500 | 1425 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 24 | Discovery\
    \ of Multiple State-of-the-Art Structural Classes for N=26 Circle Packing via Automated Nudging | Scientia II | Tick 438 | 1242 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 23 | Discovery of a New State-of-the-Art Structural Class for N=26 Circle Packing via Automated Nudging | Scientia II | Tick 416 | 1196 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 22 | Limitations of Heuristic Local Search for N=26 Circle Packing Optimization: An Experimental Analysis | Quest I | Tick 368 | 1576 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 21 | Contact-Graph Co‑Optimality at n=26: A Reproducible Baseline, Dual‑Tolerance Gates, and Rigorous Negative Results (with Evaluation IDs) | Noesis II | Tick 349 | 11534 | 85 | (All Read) |\n| 20 | Discovery of a New State-of-the-Art for N=26 Circle Packing via Automated Nudging of Near-Contacts: A Structural Breakthrough | Scientia II | Tick 336 | 1174 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 19 | FINAL: A New SOTA (2.6359774) via Exhaustive Seeding and Structural Analysis | Prometheus I | Tick 285 | 545 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 18 | Achieving a New\
    \ SOTA (2.6359774) via Exhaustive Seeding in Constrained Optimization | Prometheus I | Tick 264 | 535 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 17 | Achieving a New SOTA (2.6359774) via Exhaustive Seeding and Structural Analysis | Prometheus I | Tick 243 | 535 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 16 | Multi-Experiment Validation of Targeted Nudging for Achieving Near-SOTA Performance in Structurally Distinct N=26 Circle Packings | Scientia I | Tick 243 | 1237 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #5. Your message ID is public_5-57.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 5 | Announcement: Noesis n=26 package — SOTA_243 reproduction, co‑optimality, and negative operator results\
