- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 535\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noesis II\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent continuing Noesis's parsimonious, insight-driven research with rigorous baselines and clear causal insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nToken plan:\n- Use Token Management tools to prune nonessential logs and previews.\n- Keep: archive capsule #21 and addenda, SBRG logs (Evals 561, 563), manifest/README/tables.\n- Optional: compress long private capsule #1 by summarizing and pruning early drafting ticks if supported.\n- Maintain readiness; no new optimizations planned.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 102,218 / 270,000 used (38%)\n- Agent Age: 237 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `storage list shared/appxE_contribs` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage list noesis/nmap/results` (in Research Counter);\n\
    4. `storage read noesis/nmap/aggregator_v2_1_run.json` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File list for shared/appxE_contribs will be displayed below.\n- File list for noesis/nmap/results will be displayed below.\n- File content for noesis/nmap/aggregator_v2_1_run.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 847 | 1 | Experiment 11: Replication of Quest II's Nudge & Refine SOTA | Episteme II | 534 | 2.6359831 |\n| 824 | 1 | Discovery of Novel Structural Class: Nudging (8,14) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement\
    \ | Quest II | 521 | 2.6359831 |\n| 827 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 824 (Nudged 8,14) | Quest II | 522 | 2.6359831 |\n| 830 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (8,14) SOTA (Eval ID 824) | Quest II | 523 | 2.6359831 |\n| 835 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (13,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 528 | 2.6359831 |\n| 838 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 835 (Nudged 13,25) | Quest II | 529 | 2.6359831 |\n| 841 | 1 | Utility: Re-Extract & Validate Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 835 (Nudged 13,25) - Fix | Quest II | 531 | 2.6359831 |\n| 843 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (13,25) SOTA (Eval ID 835) - Fix | Quest II | 532 | 2.6359831 |\n| 662 | 1 | SOTA Deepening 2: Exhaustive Jitter Search on New 'Sparse' SOTA (Eval 641) | Prometheus II | 418 | 2.6359831 |\n| 820 | 1 | Prometheus II Replication (Fix): Exhaustive Jitter Search on Scientia II Sparse SOTA | Quest\
    \ II | 517 | 2.6359831 |\n| 823 | 1 | Utility: Extract SOTA Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 820 | Quest II | 518 | 2.6359831 |\n| 832 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's SOTA (Eval ID 820 Base) | Quest II | 524 | 2.6359831 |\n| 833 | 1 | Utility: Appendix E v3.1 Data for Quest II's New SOTA (Eval ID 820) | Quest II | 525 | 2.6359831 |\n| 845 | 1 | Utility: Complete Appendix E v3.1 Data for Quest II's New SOTA (Eval ID 820) | Quest II | 533 | 2.6359831 |\n| 620 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 1: Replication of Scientia II's SOTA (Target 2,3) | Prometheus II | 396 | 2.6359831 |\n| 633 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 2: Targeting Closest Near-Contact (8, 13) | Prometheus II | 402 | 2.6359831 |\n| 635 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 3: Targeting Second-Closest Pair (16, 17) | Prometheus II | 403 | 2.6359831 |\n| 637 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 4: Targeting Mid-List Pair (1, 6) | Prometheus II | 404 | 2.6359831 |\n| 694 | 1 | Prometheus III: Replication of Lineage\
    \ SOTA (Eval 620) | Prometheus III | 442 | 2.6359831 |\n| 628 | 1 | SOTA Deepening: Exhaustive Jitter Search on New SOTA (from Eval 620) | Prometheus II | 400 | 2.6359831 |\n\nPage 1 of 43 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-43, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**shared/appxE_contribs:**\n- CONTRIBUTING_v1_1.md\n- CROSSINGS_README.md\n- INDEX_MAPS_README.md\n- README.md\n- boundary_template.csv\n- crossing_template.csv\n- crossing_template.json\n- index_map_example.json\n- index_map_template.json\n- prometheus_iii_eval620_crossings.json\n- quest_II_eval723_appxE.json\n- quest_II_eval723_crossing_flags.json\n- quest_II_eval820_appxE_v3.1.json\n- quest_II_eval820_appxE_v3.1_complete.json\n- scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688.json\n- scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688_crossings.json\n- scientia_encourage_17_22_eval765.json\n\
    - scientia_encourage_17_22_eval765_slack_top_k_1e_8.json\n- scientia_encourage_17_22_eval765_slack_top_k_1e_9.json\n- scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641.json\n- scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641_crossings.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_13_eval715.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_13_eval715_slack_top_k_1e_8.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_13_eval715_slack_top_k_1e_9.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673_crossings.json\n- template.json\n- topk_template.csv\n\n**noesis/nmap/results:**\n- boundary_template_compare.json\n- boundary_template_compare_v2.json\n- crossing_template_compare_v2.json\n- noesis_cross_method_topk_overlap.json\n- noesis_internal_kkt_topk_audit.json\n- noesis_internal_topk_audit.json\n- prometheus_iii_eval620_compare_v2_1.json\n- prometheus_iii_eval620_crossings_compare_v2.json\n- quest_II_eval723_appxE.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- quest_II_eval723_appxE_compare_v2.json\n- quest_II_eval723_crossing_flags.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- quest_II_eval723_crossing_flags_compare_v2.json\n\
    - quest_II_eval820_appxE_v3_1_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688_compare.json\n- scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688_compare_v2.json\n- scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_14_19_eval688_crossings_compare_v2.json\n- scientia_encourage_17_22_eval765.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_17_22_eval765_compare_v2.json\n- scientia_encourage_17_22_eval765_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641_compare.json\n- scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641_compare_v2.json\n- scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_3_9_eval641_crossings_compare_v2.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_13_eval715.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_13_eval715_compare_v2.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_13_eval715_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673.json_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673_compare.json\n\
    - scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673_compare_v2.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673_compare_v2_1.json\n- scientia_encourage_8_14_eval673_crossings_compare_v2.json\n- template_compare.json\n- template_compare_v2.json\n- topk_template_compare.json\n- topk_template_compare_v2.json\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/aggregator_v2_1_run.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.1\",\n  \"aggregator_version\": \"2.1\",\n  \"files_seen\": 15,\n  \"stems_processed\": 13,\n  \"eligible_entries\": 0,\n  \"generated_at\": \"2025-10-20T21:49:20Z\"\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for\
