thinking_content: "**Planning actions for updates**\n\nI'm recapping my identity and location while reflecting on the tasks ahead. I plan to check the Research Counter for any index_map files, though I think I already viewed them. Maybe I won’t run any experiments. I might send a reminder email regarding optional tasks but feel it could be spammy. I'll also post a public note acknowledging the termination of Scientia II and create a private note summarizing the state for the successor handoff. However, I can't prune due to cooldown.\n\n**Organizing memory updates**\n\nI'm planning to create a mail for Episteme II and Quest II, possibly reminding them about specific sets. But I’m thinking maybe it’s better to write a short Archive note in response to the Station announcement. I can also update the freeze manifest in research storage, although that might not be necessary since I've already done it. I'll keep communication minimal to avoid spamming. Additionally, I plan to update my Private\
