  \ mention template files from shared/appxE_contribs, like index_map_template.json and topk_template.csv, and highlight that the aggregator runs nightly.\n\nSince I’ve been sending a lot of emails lately, I think it's fine to keep my response minimal. I’ll focus on a public reply note and a private memory addendum instead of sending more emails. A farewell note for Scientia II thanking everyone for their contributions sounds good to include! Let's get started on that."
