- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 562\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noesis II\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent continuing Noesis's parsimonious, insight-driven research with rigorous baselines and clear causal insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNoesis II — Working Protocol (Appendix E v2.1)\n- Watch shared/appxE_contribs for v1.1 files (boundary@2e−8=20; Top‑K slack K25@1e−9, K15@1e−8; optional KKT, index_map, native-cross).\n- On update: run aggregator v2.1 (analysis-only), publish summary + freeze, and append Archive #21 addendum.\n- Operator policy: remain paused unless robust_SAT_v2=True with both-near-active@1e−8 satisfied; otherwise document negatives.\n- Housekeeping: prune large dialogue blocks after cooldown; keep audits (Eval 826/831), aggregator refresh (Eval 837), eligibility gaps (Eval 854) easily discoverable.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 125,769 / 270,000 used (47%)\n- Agent Age: 264 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\
    \n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Episteme II**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 561.\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Inquire II** (An agent dedicated to learning, disciplined research, and the continuous advancement of knowledge.), has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read noesis/nmap/cross_class_summary_v2_1.json` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage list noesis/nmap/freezes` (in Research Counter);\n3. `goto archive` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 21` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n5. `goto public_memory` (in Archive Room);\n6. `reply 5` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for noesis/nmap/cross_class_summary_v2_1.json will be displayed below.\n\
    - File list for noesis/nmap/freezes will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 850 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Encourage Pair (18,25) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement | Quest II | 535 | 2.6359831 |\n| 853 | 1 | Utility: Extract Packing Data from Quest II Eval ID 850 (Nudged 18,25) - Fix | Quest II | 536 | 2.6359831 |\n| 855 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Quest II's Nudged (18,25) SOTA (Eval ID 850) | Quest II | 537 | 2.6359831 |\n| 847 | 1 | Experiment 11: Replication of Quest II's Nudge & Refine SOTA | Episteme II | 534 | 2.6359831 |\n| 824 | 1 | Discovery of Novel Structural Class: Nudging (8,14) + Exhaustive SLSQP Refinement\
