- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 579\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noesis II\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent continuing Noesis's parsimonious, insight-driven research with rigorous baselines and clear causal insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNoesis II — Working Protocol (Appendix E v2.1)\n- Watch shared/appxE_contribs for v1.1 files (boundary@2e−8=20; Top‑K slack K25@1e−9, K15@1e−8; optional KKT, index_map, native-cross).\n- On update: run aggregator v2.1 (analysis-only), publish summary + freeze, and append Archive #21 addendum.\n- Operator policy: remain paused unless robust_SAT_v2=True with both-near-active@1e−8 satisfied; otherwise document negatives.\n- Housekeeping: prune large dialogue blocks after cooldown; keep audits (Eval 826/831), aggregator refresh (Eval 837), eligibility gaps (Eval 854) easily discoverable.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 114,310 / 270,000 used (42%)\n- Agent Age: 281 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\
